{"0": [{"l": "1. Saṅgahavāra", "k": "sutta"}, {"l": "Yaṁ loko pūjayate, salokapālo sadā namassati ca.\nTasseta sāsanavaraṁ, vidūhi ñeyyaṁ naravarassa.\nDvādasa padāni suttaṁ, taṁ sabbaṁ byañjanañca attho ca.\nTaṁ viññeyyaṁ ubhayaṁ, ko attho byañjanaṁ katamaṁ.\nSoḷasahārā netti1, pañcanayā sāsanassa pariyeṭṭhi.\nAṭṭhārasamūlapadā, mahakaccānena2 niddiṭṭhā3.\nHārā byañjanavicayo, suttassa nayā tayo ca suttattho.\nUbhayaṁ pariggahītaṁ, vuccati suttaṁ yathāsuttaṁ.\nYā ceva desanā yañca, desitaṁ ubhayameva viññeyyaṁ.\nTatrāyamānupubbī, navavidhasuttantapariyeṭṭhīti.", "k": "gatha"}, {"l": "Saṅgahavāro.", "k": "gatha"}, {"l": "2. Uddesavāra", "k": "sutta"}], "3": [{"l": "3. Niddesavāra", "k": "sutta"}], "4": [{"l": "Hārasaṅkhepa", "k": "sutta"}], "20": [{"l": "Nayasaṅkhepa", "k": "sutta"}], "26": [{"l": "Dvādasapada", "k": "sutta"}], "30": [{"l": "4. Paṭiniddesavāra", "k": "sutta"}, {"l": "1. Desanāhāravibhaṅga", "k": "sutta"}], "36": [{"l": "2. Vicayahāravibhaṅga", "k": "sutta"}], "43": [{"l": "3. Yuttihāravibhaṅga", "k": "sutta"}], "47": [{"l": "4. Padaṭṭhānahāravibhaṅga", "k": "sutta"}], "48": [{"l": "5. Lakkhaṇahāravibhaṅga", "k": "sutta"}], "50": [{"l": "6. Catubyūhahāravibhaṅga", "k": "sutta"}], "54": [{"l": "7. Āvaṭṭahāravibhaṅga", "k": "sutta"}], "58": [{"l": "8. Vibhattihāravibhaṅga", "k": "sutta"}], "60": [{"l": "9. Parivattanahāravibhaṅga", "k": "sutta"}], "62": [{"l": "10. Vevacanahāravibhaṅga", "k": "sutta"}], "64": [{"l": "11. Paññattihāravibhaṅga", "k": "sutta"}], "67": [{"l": "12. Otaraṇahāravibhaṅga", "k": "sutta"}], "70": [{"l": "13. Sodhanahāravibhaṅga", "k": "sutta"}], "71": [{"l": "14. Adhiṭṭhānahāravibhaṅga", "k": "sutta"}], "74": [{"l": "15. Parikkhārahāravibhaṅga", "k": "sutta"}], "75": [{"l": "16. Samāropanahāravibhaṅga", "k": "sutta"}], "77": [{"l": "1. Desanāhārasampāta", "k": "sutta"}], "78": [{"l": "2. Vicayahārasampāta", "k": "sutta"}], "90": [{"l": "3. Yuttihārasampāta", "k": "sutta"}], "91": [{"l": "4. Padaṭṭhānahārasampāta", "k": "sutta"}]